# One gate per line:  name | directory (from the repo root) | command
# Copy to scripts/gates.conf. Keep every gate that CLAUDE.md lists under "Primary Commands".
# A gate that cannot fail is not a gate: a command that checks nothing (e.g. `tsc --noEmit -p .` on a project that
# uses project references) is worse than none.
lint      | .  | ruff check .
test      | .  | pytest -q
typecheck | ui | npm run typecheck
frontend  | ui | npm run test -- --run
md-wrap   | .  | python3 scripts/md_wrap_check.py
